WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.940
I'm the bottom half of the lunar module Eagle.

2
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:16.080
I was the launch pad for Neil and Buzz's trip home, so I stayed behind. Next to me is a small mirror.

3
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:25.850
Every so often a laser beam from Earth finds it, bounces off, and tells scientists exactly how far away the Moon is.

4
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.700
Here men from the planet Earth first set foot upon the Moon.
